{
  "//": [
    "Template for appsettings.json - copy the values you need into your own",
    "local configuration. Never commit real credentials.",
    "",
    "Preferred ways to supply secrets, in order:",
    "  1. .NET user secrets:  dotnet user-secrets set \"EmailSetting:SmtpPassword\" \"...\"",
    "  2. Environment variables (double underscore = nesting):",
    "     EmailSetting__SmtpPassword=...  ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=...",
    "  3. Docker Compose:     see .env.example and docker-compose.yml",
    "The API reads appsettings.json, then appsettings.{Environment}.json, then",
    "user secrets, then environment variables - later sources win."
  ],

  "Logging": {
    "LogLevel": {
      "Default": "Information",
      "Microsoft.AspNetCore": "Warning"
    }
  },

  "AllowedHosts": "*",

  "ConnectionStrings": {
    "DefaultConnection": "mongodb://<user>:<password>@localhost:27017/EmailTrackingAPI?authSource=admin"
  },

  "EmailSetting": {
    "SmtpServer": "smtp.gmail.com",
    "SmtpPort": 587,
    "SmtpUser": "<your-smtp-username>",
    "SmtpPassword": "<your-smtp-password-or-app-password>",
    "SenderEmail": "<the-from-address>"
  }
}
